inical quality of a standard eye test is the same regardless of which optician you visit, as all UK optometrists are qualified to the same professional standard and regulated by the General Optical Council. The main differences between providers tend to be in the additional technology offered, the range of frames and lenses available, and the time allocated to each appointment."]}],"$L36"]}]}]}]
