36:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":["Many patients in ","Lincoln"," are eligible for free NHS-funded eye tests and do not need to pay anything at all. Even if you are not eligible, a private eye test at ","Boots"," represents excellent value for one of the most important health checks available. Use eyetest.co.uk to compare prices across all opticians near ","LN1 3BH"," and find the best deal for your needs."]}]
